    values:originalText "In this Division: cause a person to engage in sexual intercourse or other sexual activity has the meaning given by section 272.2. offence, in the case of a reference to an offence against this Division or against a particular provision of it, has a meaning affected by section 272.5. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Schedule 1  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children" ;
