concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-272-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "272 2  When conduct causes a person to engage in sexual intercourse"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-272-3 ;
    values:originalText "or other sexual activity  For the purposes of this Division, a person’s conduct causes another person to engage in sexual intercourse or other sexual activity if it substantially contributes to the other person engaging in sexual intercourse or other sexual activity." ;
    skos:definition "or other sexual activity  For the purposes of this Division, a person’s conduct causes another person to engage in sexual intercourse or other sexual activity if it substantially contributes to the other person engaging in sexual intercourse or other sexual activity."@en ;
