concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-272-16-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "272(4) 15  “Grooming” child to engage in sexual activity outside"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-272-16-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it does not matter that the child is a fictitious person represented to the person as a real person. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to child sex offences outside Australia  Part 1" ;
    skos:definition "(4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it does not matter that the child is a fictitious person represented to the person as a real person. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to child sex offences outside Australia  Part 1"@en ;
