doc:sch-1-sec-272-23 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "272 20  Preparing for or planning offence against this Division" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Offences involving sexual intercourse or other sexual activity with child, and benefiting offence  (1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person does an act; and  (b) the person does so with the intention of preparing for, or planning, an offence against section 272.8, 272.9, 272.10," ;
