    cml:conclusionText "...so far as these matters are relevant and known to the court." ;
    cml:executionSurface "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sch-1-sec-272-36-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "272(1) 30  Sentencing" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) In determining the sentence to be passed, or the order to be made, in respect of a person for an offence against Subdivision B of this Division, the court must take into account the age and maturity of the person in relation to whom the offence was committed, so far as these matters are relevant and known to the court." ;
    cof:pageNumber "28"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-272-36-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "272(2) 30  Sentencing"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-272-36-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The matters mentioned in subsection (1) are in addition to any other matters the court must take into account (for example, the matters mentioned in subsection 16A(2) of the Crimes Act 1914). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to child sex offences outside Australia  Part 1" ;
