concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-471-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "471 17, 471.19 or 471.20."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-471-8 ;
    values:originalText "(3) To avoid doubt, a person does not commit an offence against section 471.16, 471.17, 471.19 or 471.20 for the purposes of paragraph (1)(a) if the person has a defence to that offence. Offence or conduct need not be the same  (4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether the offence, or the conduct constituting the offence, is the same on each occasion. Double jeopardy etc.  (5) A person who has been convicted or acquitted of an offence (the aggravated offence) against this section may not be convicted of an offence against section 471.16, 471.17, 471.19 or 471.20 in relation to the conduct that constituted the aggravated offence.  (6) Subsection (5) does not prevent an alternative verdict under section 471.23.  (7) A person who has been convicted or acquitted of an offence (the underlying offence) against section 471.16, 471.17, 471.19 or" ;
    skos:definition "(3) To avoid doubt, a person does not commit an offence against section 471.16, 471.17, 471.19 or 471.20 for the purposes of paragraph (1)(a) if the person has a defence to that offence. Offence or conduct need not be the same  (4) For the purposes of subsection (1), it is immaterial whether the offence, or the conduct constituting the offence, is the same on each occasion. Double jeopardy etc.  (5) A person who has been convicted or acquitted of an offence (the aggravated offence) against this section may not be convicted of an offence against section 471.16, 471.17, 471.19 or 471.20 in relation to the conduct that constituted the aggravated offence.  (6) Subsection (5) does not prevent an alternative verdict under section 471.23.  (7) A person who has been convicted or acquitted of an offence (the underlying offence) against section 471.16, 471.17, 471.19 or"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "917cdf11fce8b2fd417a3ac9a888455820b9614f54b01c07983b88de2f510b93" ;
