concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-471-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "471 17, 471.19 or 471.20;"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-471-11 ;
    values:originalText "it may find the defendant not guilty of the aggravated offence but guilty of the underlying offence, so long as the defendant has been accorded procedural fairness in relation to that finding of guilt. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to child sex offences involving postal or similar services, or carriage services  Part 2  Subdivision C—Offences relating to use of postal or similar service involving sexual activity with person under 16" ;
    skos:definition "it may find the defendant not guilty of the aggravated offence but guilty of the underlying offence, so long as the defendant has been accorded procedural fairness in relation to that finding of guilt. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to child sex offences involving postal or similar services, or carriage services  Part 2  Subdivision C—Offences relating to use of postal or similar service involving sexual activity with person under 16"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "98b3fd71013550f6fad3cb43e1beabfd5dbc43295311010e6488fc02a41555e2" ;
    cof:pageNumber "44"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Procedural fairness in relation to finding of guilt." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010.pdf> ;
