doc:sch-1-sec-471-13-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "471(2) 25  Using a postal or similar service to “groom” persons under" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person (the sender) commits an offence if:  (a) the sender causes an article to be carried by a postal or similar service to another person (the recipient); and  (b) the sender does this with the intention of making it easier to procure the recipient to engage in sexual activity with another person (the participant); and  (c) the recipient is someone who is, or who the sender believes to be, under 16; and  (d) the participant is someone who is, or who the sender believes to be, at least 18. Penalty: Imprisonment for 12 years." ;
    cof:pageNumber "46"^^xsd:integer .

