concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-471-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "471 27  Age-related provisions relating to offences against this"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-471-15 ;
    values:originalText "Subdivision Application of absolute liability  (1) For the purposes of an offence against this Subdivision, absolute liability applies to the physical element of circumstance of the offence that the recipient is someone who is under 16. Note 1: For absolute liability, see section 6.2. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Schedule 1  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children" ;
    skos:definition "Subdivision Application of absolute liability  (1) For the purposes of an offence against this Subdivision, absolute liability applies to the physical element of circumstance of the offence that the recipient is someone who is under 16. Note 1: For absolute liability, see section 6.2. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Schedule 1  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0371eee618ad4165def35201ff73ddc043614d27ef7c0af016bcb4c281b10631" ;
    cof:pageNumber "47"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Absolute liability applies to physical element of circumstance that the recipient is under 16." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
