concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-473 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "473 5  Use of a carriage service"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-473 ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of this Part, a person is taken not to use a carriage service by engaging in particular conduct if:  (a) the person is a carrier and, in engaging in that conduct, is acting solely in the person’s capacity as a carrier; or  (b) the person is a carriage service provider and, in engaging in that conduct, is acting solely in the person’s capacity as a carriage service provider; or  (c) the person is an internet service provider and, in engaging in that conduct, is acting solely in the person’s capacity as an internet service provider; or  (d) the person is an internet content host and, in engaging in that conduct, is acting solely in the person’s capacity as an internet content host. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to child sex offences involving postal or similar services, or carriage services  Part 2" ;
    skos:definition "For the purposes of this Part, a person is taken not to use a carriage service by engaging in particular conduct if:  (a) the person is a carrier and, in engaging in that conduct, is acting solely in the person’s capacity as a carrier; or  (b) the person is a carriage service provider and, in engaging in that conduct, is acting solely in the person’s capacity as a carriage service provider; or  (c) the person is an internet service provider and, in engaging in that conduct, is acting solely in the person’s capacity as an internet service provider; or  (d) the person is an internet content host and, in engaging in that conduct, is acting solely in the person’s capacity as an internet content host. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to child sex offences involving postal or similar services, or carriage services  Part 2"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "20e79088837f8b0a079d5af3a9178389f15a014b37107e4ce1906faf316b7746" ;
    cof:pageNumber "50"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemptions from use of carriage services" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010.pdf, p.50" ;
    cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-473-norm .
