concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-474 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "474 24A  Aggravated offence—offence involving conduct on 3 or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-474 ;
    values:originalText "more occasions and 2 or more people  (1) A person commits an offence against this section if:  (a) the person commits an offence against one or more of the following provisions on 3 or more separate occasions:  (i) section 474.19 (using a carriage service for child pornography material);  (ii) section 474.20 (possessing etc. child pornography material for use through a carriage service);  (iii) section 474.22 (using a carriage service for child abuse material); ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to child sex offences involving postal or similar services, or carriage services  Part 2  (iv) section 474.23 (possessing etc. child abuse material for use through a carriage service); and  (b) the commission of each such offence involves 2 or more people. Penalty: Imprisonment for 25 years.  (2) There is no fault element for any of the physical elements described in paragraph (1)(a) other than the fault elements (however described), if any, for the offence against section 474.19," ;
    skos:definition "more occasions and 2 or more people  (1) A person commits an offence against this section if:  (a) the person commits an offence against one or more of the following provisions on 3 or more separate occasions:  (i) section 474.19 (using a carriage service for child pornography material);  (ii) section 474.20 (possessing etc. child pornography material for use through a carriage service);  (iii) section 474.22 (using a carriage service for child abuse material); ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to child sex offences involving postal or similar services, or carriage services  Part 2  (iv) section 474.23 (possessing etc. child abuse material for use through a carriage service); and  (b) the commission of each such offence involves 2 or more people. Penalty: Imprisonment for 25 years.  (2) There is no fault element for any of the physical elements described in paragraph (1)(a) other than the fault elements (however described), if any, for the offence against section 474.19,"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a4e3b7a93791bc6b370f3e3b1ac5ae5cf8df9b7f454288cc58b605859c206723" ;
    cof:pageNumber "52"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-474-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-474-ss-2 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
