doc:sch-1-sec-474-7-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "474(1) 25A  Using a carriage service for sexual activity with person" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person engages in sexual activity with another person (the child) using a carriage service; and  (b) the child is under 16 years of age; and  (c) the person is at least 18 years of age. Penalty: Imprisonment for 15 years. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Amendments relating to child sex offences involving postal or similar services, or carriage services  Part 2  Causing child to engage in sexual activity with another person" ;
    cof:pageNumber "54"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-474-7-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "474(2) 25A  Using a carriage service for sexual activity with person"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-474-7-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person (the defendant) commits an offence if:  (a) the defendant engages in conduct in relation to another person (the child); and  (b) that conduct causes the child to engage in sexual activity with another person (the participant) using a carriage service; and  (c) the child is under 16 years of age when the sexual activity is engaged in; and  (d) the participant is at least 18 years of age when the sexual activity is engaged in. Penalty: Imprisonment for 15 years." ;
    skos:definition "(2) A person (the defendant) commits an offence if:  (a) the defendant engages in conduct in relation to another person (the child); and  (b) that conduct causes the child to engage in sexual activity with another person (the participant) using a carriage service; and  (c) the child is under 16 years of age when the sexual activity is engaged in; and  (d) the participant is at least 18 years of age when the sexual activity is engaged in. Penalty: Imprisonment for 15 years."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7aeeda7895bab416555407b3a5f346abc79f726c969d28d212e7363fb00994a3" ;
    values:partOf concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-474-7 ;
