concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-474-8 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "474 25B  Aggravated offence—child with mental impairment or"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-474-8 ;
    values:originalText "under care, supervision or authority of defendant  (1) A person commits an offence against this section if:  (a) the person commits an offence against either of the following provisions in relation to another person (the child):  (i) subsection 474.25A(1) (engaging in sexual activity with child using a carriage service);  (ii) subsection 474.25A(2) (causing child to engage in sexual activity with another person); and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Schedule 1  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children" ;
    skos:definition "under care, supervision or authority of defendant  (1) A person commits an offence against this section if:  (a) the person commits an offence against either of the following provisions in relation to another person (the child):  (i) subsection 474.25A(1) (engaging in sexual activity with child using a carriage service);  (ii) subsection 474.25A(2) (causing child to engage in sexual activity with another person); and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Schedule 1  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children"@en ;
