    values:originalText "Insert: make available, in relation to material, includes, but is not limited to, describing how to obtain access, or describing methods that are likely to facilitate access, to material (for example: by setting out the name of a website, an IP address, a URL, a password, or the name of a newsgroup). ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Schedule 1  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children" ;
