    values:originalText "ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Consequential amendments  Part 3  The amendments made by items 62 and 63 apply in relation to a controlled operation authorised on or after the commencement of this item, whether the offence was committed before, on or after that commencement." ;
    skos:definition "ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Consequential amendments  Part 3  The amendments made by items 62 and 63 apply in relation to a controlled operation authorised on or after the commencement of this item, whether the offence was committed before, on or after that commencement."@en ;
