concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-77 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "77 Subsection 5D(3B)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-77 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the subsection, substitute: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Consequential amendments  Part 3  Sexual offences against children and offences involving child pornography  (3B) An offence is also a serious offence if:  (a) it is an offence against Division 272 or 273, Subdivision B or C of Division 471, or Subdivision D or F of Division 474, of the Criminal Code; or  (b) the particular conduct constituting the offence otherwise involved, involves or would involve:  (i) the production, publication, possession, supply or sale of, or other dealing in, child pornography; or  (ii) consenting to or procuring the employment of a child, or employing a child, in connection with child pornography." ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the subsection, substitute: ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00042  Amendments relating to sexual offences against children  Schedule 1 Consequential amendments  Part 3  Sexual offences against children and offences involving child pornography  (3B) An offence is also a serious offence if:  (a) it is an offence against Division 272 or 273, Subdivision B or C of Division 471, or Subdivision D or F of Division 474, of the Criminal Code; or  (b) the particular conduct constituting the offence otherwise involved, involves or would involve:  (i) the production, publication, possession, supply or sale of, or other dealing in, child pornography; or  (ii) consenting to or procuring the employment of a child, or employing a child, in connection with child pornography."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3e4e7f6c5df9ccf00e10d4d56cd8f0360ae43323a2e3326c8aef00257b3d844f" ;
    cof:pageNumber "66"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Repeal of subsection and substitution with new provisions related to sexual offences against children." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010.pdf> ;
