concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010-sch-1-sec-78 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "78 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-78 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subitems (2) and (3), subsection 5D(3B) of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979, as in force on and after the commencement of this item, applies in relation to an offence committed on or after that commencement. (2) Subsection 5D(3B) of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979, as in force on and after the commencement of this item, applies in relation to:  (a) an offence against section 474.19, 474.20, 474.22, 474.23," ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to subitems (2) and (3), subsection 5D(3B) of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979, as in force on and after the commencement of this item, applies in relation to an offence committed on or after that commencement. (2) Subsection 5D(3B) of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979, as in force on and after the commencement of this item, applies in relation to:  (a) an offence against section 474.19, 474.20, 474.22, 474.23,"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8851a66d43978443540eb20960da4825d0ecc2759d1bef1394d03a6bf42fab86" ;
    cof:pageNumber "67"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Applicability of subsection 5D(3B) of the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-sexual-offences-against-children-act-2010.pdf> ;
